---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us · Mental Note" active="about">
<div class="phead"><div class="wrap">
  <h1>About Us</h1>
</div></div>
<div class="light"><div class="block" style="padding-top:56px"><div class="wrap rv">
  <h2>Co-founders</h2>
  <div class="people">
    <div class="person">
      <div class="photo paper lit tape dk"><div class="in2">Photo</div><div class="cap">Co-founder 1</div></div>
      <h3>Co-founder 1</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="person">
      <div class="photo paper lit tape dk"><div class="in2">Photo</div><div class="cap">Co-founder 2</div></div>
      <h3>Co-founder 2</h3>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div>

<div class="block" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap rv">
  <h2>A Non-Profit</h2>
  <dl class="qa">
    <div><dt>How we're structured</dt><dd>Independent and peer-led. We've applied for fiscal sponsorship; until it's approved we run as a student project.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>What we do with data</dt><dd>We never sell it, share it, or use it to train anything. Check-ins never leave your phone.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>The book</dt><dd>One founder's book is her own work, published separately. It isn't a program of Mental Note.</dd></div>
  </dl>
</div></div>

<div class="block" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap rv">
  <h2>Purpose</h2>
  <p class="lead">We started Mental Note to give people a place to say what they're thinking, and to make sure anyone who needs support can find it. We're high school students, not counselors. We write about mental health from our own experience and point people to professionals when they need real help.</p>
</div></div>

<div class="block" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap rv">
  <h2>Goals</h2>
  <ul class="goals">
    <li>Post a new article every two weeks.</li>
    <li>Open a new theme on the wall every week.</li>
    <li>Keep the app and everything on this site free.</li>
    <li>Get fiscal sponsorship so donations can be tax-deductible.</li>
  </ul>
</div></div></div>
</Layout>
